1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
A student needs the pH of zero point

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:06,040
one five zero moles per litre propanoic acid.

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:09,440
They treat it like hydrochloric acid: the hydronium

