52
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:11,340
Now check that dropping x was fair.

53
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:14,460
x is zero point nine three percent of

54
00:02:14,540 --> 00:02:17,340
zero point one five zero, well under the

55
00:02:17,420 --> 00:02:18,700
five percent rule of thumb.

56
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:22,940
So at equilibrium, hydronium and propanoate are both

57
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:25,100
one point four times ten to the minus

58
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:27,660
three, and the acid is still about zero

59
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:29,220
point one four nine.

60
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:32,380
The pH is two point eight five: x

61
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:34,940
